{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "e83ae79a157952cf57c5a8ade72f1fafd3ef955dc33efc4056ed3ff2e42bad8b", "ja": "揺らぎの前奏", "zh": "摇曳的前奏", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9900bd55ceff0b649ab3e1deb6d376a3620745af33fab133de87b5df051c6f50", "ja": "転校生を紹介する全校集会が開かれる。生徒\n会長として壇上に立ったあずさは、転校生が\n幼馴染の育である事に気づく。思わぬ再会を\n喜ぶふたり。だが海美の胸中は穏やかでは\nなく、苛立ちを育へとぶつけてしまい……。", "zh": "全校召开了介绍转校生的集会。作为学生会长站在台上的梓，发现转校生竟然是自己的青梅竹马育。两人为意外重逢而欣喜不已。然而海美的心情却无法平静，竟把烦躁发泄到了育身上……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "a56c78a7ef0edf90307e42cca890fbc5193610a68d5e12316364813da630dd09", "ja": "聖ミリオン女学園、礼拝堂……", "zh": "圣百万女学园，礼拜堂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "4094c0ed80af36595f396e859f308711ff504c4ecae997eeac43235bfa3fc96b", "ja": "転校生って、全校集会で紹介されるんだ……。\nうう、なんだか緊張するかも……。", "zh": "原来转校生会在全校集会上被介绍啊……。\n呜，总觉得有点紧张……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "0102c1ff3dc0193a1bfec6b0257814143c8137e10bf62c9c3e428e26d2287902", "ja": "そんなに緊張しなくても大丈夫。\n学園長も先生方も、優しい人達だからねぇ。", "zh": "不用这么紧张啦。\n校长和老师们都是很温柔的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "00b8fed46263fb41f9a4438251ff438093cfe2d8884f7cb86b1f9030e86d5a36", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\nえっと……木下、さん？", "zh": "啊，谢谢你。\n那个……木下同学？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "dfc42968e679824794cd56aafad84df36774629add353c0edd946e22814680d8", "ja": "クラスメイトだし、ひなたでいいよぉ。\nわからないことがあったら、なんでも聞いてね。", "zh": "既然是同班同学，叫我日向就好啦。\n有什么不明白的，尽管问我哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "80f9a81b43ed14d50beb20c480b788b01fc3c2713fcbff5bdb86dfb15f7d8923", "ja": "あっ……うん！　ありがとう、ひなたさん。\nわたしは、中谷育っていいます。よろしくね♪", "zh": "啊……嗯！谢谢你，日向小姐。\n我叫中谷育。请多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "65160741acd8c03f56c8baa079a353072a80fa67df1b9977cdfd79390148ebc2", "ja": "そろそろ、生徒会長の挨拶が始まるね。\n今、壇上に上がった人。あれが生徒会長だよぉ。", "zh": "差不多要开始学生会长的致辞了。现在走上台的那个人，就是学生会长哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "2562cfb7dff1c1371b294d1a2c8181f240ba0f3d9a30d92e006bbce0c8bcd183", "ja": "この学園の生徒会長は、ミス・ラベンダーって\n呼ばれていて、みんなの憧れの存在なんだぁ。ほら。", "zh": "这所学园的学生会长被大家称为“薰衣草小姐”，是所有人憧憬的对象哦。你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "a1fdbba14da17f928f106c8e6f20db9855ba30963c13c764e23c581ee51cab8e", "ja": "ミス・ラベンダー……え？\nあ、あずさお姉ちゃん！？", "zh": "薰衣草小姐……咦？\n梓、梓梓姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "9f7daa87a38174516c5c809608a2a6399379ba2cb2bce3b4941b21d8f6abf9e4", "ja": "今の声、もしかして……。", "zh": "刚才的声音，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "2b17c08ba430e7638754ed8573b0952c8f55f6680267462711c225be2047e118", "ja": "あっ、会長！？", "zh": "啊，会长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "083f85430a8e264e41ac4d4c667c64e0b8ff63745bee7dd164aef2f8e7e0f223", "ja": "まぁ……♪　やっぱり、育ちゃんね！\nこんなに大きくなって……♪", "zh": "哎呀……♪果然是育呢！\n都长得这么大了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "d64444a1034b74aa10c0b21690d6c3ac34c457c63b61d478d53f786533698aab", "ja": "あっ……あ、あの、ごめんなさい！\nわたし、急に大きな声を出したりして……。", "zh": "啊……那、那个，对不起！\n我突然就大声喊起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "317f23c1c1b78e66455560f2191d8c15ada1ec9de2735a40455847ef2f0cc2a3", "ja": "そんなこと、気にしなくていいのよ。\nそれより、どうしてこの学園に？　戻ってきたの？", "zh": "那种事不用在意啦。比起这个，你为什么会来这所学园？是回来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "7bcd28c86745a8ff1ca159820a02227bf879813ed33a37647c17f5560f7271a3", "ja": "か、会長！　朝礼中ですよ！\n早く壇上に戻ってください！", "zh": "会、会长！现在正在开晨会呢！\n请快点回到台上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "0d4dd91125575b34d6446817dd9623dd64b33c59297dba2e5ef022dee75f66eb", "ja": "まあ、いけない。そうだったわ。\n……それじゃ育ちゃん、また後で……。", "zh": "哎呀，真是不好。还真是呢。\n……那育，我们之后再见吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "126e90d8cd123166d9658a3ae4882cd38a1140679a85b5b5a48de420d243c23a", "ja": "びっくりしたけど、ほんとに、あずさお姉ちゃんだ。\n全然変わってないみたい……。", "zh": "虽然吓了一跳，但真的是梓姐姐。\n好像完全没变……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1017_student1", "source_sha256": "84e64acabec595a5ed3cd2202560a70479292eeb39d7230df5af2a46d18880c7", "ja": "あの転校生、ミス・ラベンダーの\nお知り合い……？", "zh": "那个转校生，是薰衣草小姐的熟人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1018_student2", "source_sha256": "30d902dd8a6b8c6d57c8fc951a9e62970110c4a1eec91407826e82ab79dad6f7", "ja": "なんだか、ずいぶんと親しげでしたけれど……。", "zh": "总觉得……关系亲密得有些过头了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "d51f946fc4eb46aecee592559a0f7709c5fe7d1dd6b32fbc50bbdb00c650f5b5", "ja": "ミス・ラベンダーの……？\n海美、貴女、あの子のこと知ってるの？", "zh": "薰衣草小姐的……？\n海美，你认识那个孩子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "3ea365846cafdf5ee3516d76487e9d730ad397781d851a0e2554954b490df80e", "ja": "……知らない。", "zh": "……不知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1021_null", "source_sha256": "f5381c55910e051b5a5e087de97e09356b349a2367859e799911b2c965b8c79b", "ja": "昼休み……", "zh": "午休时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "6c0fef01cb2d2b4d00dae15d7467f5bfa1d046f2f5fed0355af337de82e225ed", "ja": "失礼。あなた……そう、そこの転校生さん。\nすこし、お話させていただけるかしら？", "zh": "打扰了。你……对，那边那位转学生。\n能稍微占用你一点时间说几句吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1023_030iku", "source_sha256": "842f2e1fb71dd9f3689997382f34e252dad555569be0726be15d91894abb0de9", "ja": "え？　わ、わたしですか……？", "zh": "诶？我、我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "25ce7b1adb7a238c9aa3c12a6e0f63eef33fd2b9b1ddbbcffea703d2e9a0dfb6", "ja": "あっ！　……育さん、この人は会長さんの妹で2年の\n高坂海美さん……次のミス・ラベンダー候補だよぉ。", "zh": "啊！……育，这位是会长的妹妹、2年的高坂海美小姐……也是下一任薰衣草小姐的候选人哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "3e4b3fd95a705571c347c74ed8c989a55291fe7b81a9c218711ac186377a4483", "ja": "妹？　でも、あずさお姉ちゃんに\n妹はいなかったと思うけど……。", "zh": "妹妹？可是，我记得梓姐姐\n应该没有妹妹才对呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "e840a7e6334cc9eec6d20ba100eba702b3da6f9f1b7f31836a92f5403d7da3b4", "ja": "聖ミリオン女学園には、後輩が立派な乙女になれるよう\n先輩が指導する、姉妹制度っていうのがあるんだぁ。", "zh": "圣百万女学园里有一种叫作姐妹制度的制度，为了让后辈成为优秀的淑女，前辈会负责指导她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "466c9272922572b887049ed227ce4f9b04b1e0dc0c9dc7bdcd0d7b45ff749467", "ja": "3年生には、花の名前がついていてね。\n妹の後輩が、それを引き継いでいくんだよぉ。", "zh": "3年级的学姐都有花的名字哦。\n而作为妹妹的后辈，会把那个名字继承下去呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "c1a4cd820c7c9893f27546abe04c5211d9012a05ff35e5b1d4efd1d9d3078ff8", "ja": "そうなんだ……！", "zh": "原来是这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "0d232faa2366ed3e0bf680929970788b1e2437188139231e7c09cff84091e647", "ja": "あなた、ミス・ラベンダー……私のお姉さまと\n旧知のようでしたけど、どういうご関係？", "zh": "您，薰衣草小姐……您好像和我姐姐是旧识，请问您和她是什么关系？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "d83cef010f97f8f45aae9d8afb588c9fa6d621e16e2c3362ea8df76b4a4fa308", "ja": "あっ、あの。\nわたし、あずさお姉ちゃんとは幼なじみで……。", "zh": "啊，那个。\n我和梓姐姐是青梅竹马……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "a000179b0f4d827396f5a09c2a5e524eb924fddcc00c188d671352fe6a7c7718", "ja": "あずさお姉ちゃん……？", "zh": "梓姐姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "c6627e020615079fa28b3a0b1b3e828c55c34bcd8eb2cedd962b95a898d6a086", "ja": "……昔どうだったかは知らないけど、\nあずさお姉さまは我が校の生徒会長なのよ！", "zh": "……我不管以前怎么样，\n梓姐姐可是我们学校的学生会长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "f610083f32e498f4070aad6f3fbe46ad614998b40b31e5242e6ff1e6591d45b6", "ja": "あずさお姉さまを、お姉さまと呼んでいいのは私だけ！\n一般の生徒は、ミス・ラベンダーと呼びなさい！", "zh": "能称呼梓姐姐大人为姐姐大人的只有我！\n一般的学生，就给我叫她薰衣草小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_02_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "3596b3f628325a303d9071621e99d55a49174b1012778018ba6d935b1d3900d8", "ja": "ちょっと海美、何をしているの……！？\n貴女たち、もう行ったほうがいいわ。", "zh": "等等，海美，你在做什么……！？\n你们还是先走比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
